[20.303906, "o", "git show HEAD\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?1h\u001b=\r\u001b[33mcommit fb8efa4b1bfa4347404cec341a218710035a1051\u001b[m\u001b[33m (\u001b[m\u001b[1;36mHEAD -> \u001b[m\u001b[1;32mmaster\u001b[m\u001b[33m)\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\nAuthor: Test User <test@example.com>\u001b[m\r\nDate:   Fri Apr 3 07:47:18 2026 +0000\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\n    Move to Stanford\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mdiff --git a/_includes/about.md b/_includes/about.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1mindex ebf11b4..c542eae 100644\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m--- a/_includes/about.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[1m+++ b/_includes/about.md\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[36m@@ -1,3 +1,3 @@\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31m-I am a sixth PhD candidate at the [Paul G. Allen School of Computer Science & Engineering](https://www.cs.washington.edu/) at The University of Washington, whe\u001b[m \b\u001b[31mre I am advised by [Tim Althoff](http://www.timalthoff.com/). I am affiliated with [UW NLP](https://twitter.com/uwnlp).\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m+\u001b[m\u001b[32mI am a Postdoctoral Researcher at Stanford CS.\u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n \u001b[m\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[31m- Previously, I was a Student Researcher at [Google Research](https://research.google/), an ML Research Intern at [Apple Health AI](https://machinelearning.appl\u001b[m \b\u001b[31me."]
